# Env files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
# Committed env files must be PUBLIC ONLY (URLs/IDs, never tokens/keys/DSNs).
# The whitelist is scoped to the frontends, whose .env.{dev,prod}/.env.local-*
# carry only VITE_/NEXT_PUBLIC_ public config. Backend handloom-admin/.env.*
# holds real secrets (POSTGRES_DSN, PhonePe/MSG91 keys) and stays IGNORED —
# those are sourced at deploy time from the shell / CI secrets, never committed.
# Local overrides go in .env.local (still ignored).
!handloom-admin-frontend/.env.dev
!handloom-admin-frontend/.env.prod
!handloom-admin-frontend/.env.local-backend
!handloom-admin-frontend/.env.local-lambda
!homechrome-store/.env.local-lambda

